    "enUS": {
      "description": "<A weathered crest depicting the mark of Lordaeron. With so few relics left after the kingdom's fall, someone in the Undercity would be very keen to get their hands on this.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "5e6c451df1c36d8bf5b3": "<Oran bites the crest to ensure authenticity.>\n\nWell I'll be. A genuine relic of our home. Mostly intact, too. We need to be extra careful with this one.\n\nThank you for your aid in restoring our history, $c. I'll see to it that we take good care of this.",
        "d6d709d559447c8d0215": "What have you got there, $c? A tasty morsel?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Crest of Lordaeron to Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity.",
      "title": "Crest of Lordaeron",
      "translationMetadata": {
